        "Description": "Tung Tung Tung Tung Tung Tung Tung Tung Tung Tímea returns this time trying to commit 9/11 with bilewater. The Towers didnt fall but 5 people got sick and died. Amongst these people is the sign brothers. they are actually wearing each others clothes right now so you will have to fix that. Fabian beat Triple T (rest in peace) in a tennis match so he has to go. The last 2 targets are a random security guard and a guy in a ugly sweater. I will leave you to prepare!\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\r\rGroal the great",
